                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per turn, during this Character’s activation, choose an UNENGAGED Enemy Character within 13” and Line of Sight to make an OPPOSED POWER TEST. If they fail, they must take the COWER reaction immediately (if possible).</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="d26d-e8b4-4c72-f338" name="Bune’s Heads" type="upgrade" hidden="false">
              <profiles>
                <profile id="f9c9-a7b5-f457-1780" name="Bune’s Heads" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="91" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Dread Diplomacy bargain</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per turn, during this Character’s activation, another Friendly Character within 13” and Line of Sight of this Character may immediately remove up to 3 STRESS as a FREE ACTION.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="14c7-00ab-41dc-57ae" name="Bathin’s Horse" type="upgrade" hidden="false">
              <profiles>
                <profile id="6df2-4bb6-d660-e6c5" name="Bathin’s Horse" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="91" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Dread Diplomacy bargain</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per turn, during this Character’s activation, an UNENGAGED Friendly Character (including this one) within 13” and Line of Sight may immediately be placed within 6” of their original position.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="6504-6df4-ec0e-1c5d" name="Dread Diplomacy" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="91" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Hierophant only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">You may choose to strike a bargain with an Outsider Entity. When you do, your Hierophant loses 2 POWER and picks a new ability from the following list:</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="3b05-fdec-9435-78d2" name="The Black Crown" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="91" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="45" />
      </costs>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="6b72-5da2-bd50-d9ba" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="89cf-3c01-38e5-bb2c" name="The Black Crown" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="91" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Hierophant only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per turn, when another friendly MORTAL or WITCH successfully activates, the wearer may make a POWER TEST (1). On a success, the wearer possesses that Character until the end of its activation. While possessed, the Character replaces its profile abilities and POWER stat with those printed on the Hierophant’s profile. Otherwise, it retains its own attributes, traits, weapons and assets.
The wearer may attempt possession even after death. If the wearer has been killed, use their printed POWER for the possession test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="280e-567b-0d9c-8da0" name="The Thirteenth Key" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="98" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="15" />
      </costs>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="4c23-88d3-fd4f-8ce7" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="4e97-5279-2d28-2245" name="The Thirteenth Key" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="98" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per turn, when this Character successfully activates within 3″ of a Place of Power, you may place it in a legal position within 3″ of another Place of Power. This placement does not generate a CHARGE ATTACK but DISENGAGE TESTS are required as normal.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="5b83-9b46-c83d-0795" name="His Infernal Blade" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="98" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="15" />
      </costs>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="112c-2c17-e6ea-b944" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="f6a6-e7e0-8531-6a79" name="His Infernal Blade" typeId="d1f1-5d47-a755-8b5f" typeName="Weapon" hidden="false" page="98" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Velocity" typeId="f173-8d0e-3d35-61a4">+1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Potency" typeId="eca4-f354-09c4-9fb7">MORTAL</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits and range" typeId="5aca-a7b8-a2de-08fa">Forbidden. Unique. Melee.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Blood Price: Once per casting test, after all dice and any opposing test have been resolved, this character may lose 1 VITALITY to add one success to its casting result. This loss cannot be reduced by RESILIENCE.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="e455-cd21-0da0-3f6e" name="Infernal Contract" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="99" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="40" />
      </costs>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="75bc-0e92-d52a-dd02" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="54ec-5e02-9422-8d0c" name="Infernal Contract" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="99" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Witch only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">At the beginning of the Reset Phase, if this character has been killed and at least one friendly DEVIL character is on the battlefield, you may permanently remove one of your crew's Activation Tokens from the game to return this character to play. This may be a token in the Chaos Bag or one assigned to a character that would otherwise return to the bag during Reset. PROGRAM and Diablerie Tokens cannot be sacrificed. The Character is regurgitated back onto the battlefield. Place the returning character in a legal position in base contact with a friendly DEVIL. It returns with its full maximum VITALITY, no Stress, its original profile, and all weapons and assets it possessed when killed. It has no assigned Activation Token and may activate normally from the next Action Phase. If this character ordinarily contributes an Activation Token, restore that token to your crew's supply during this Reset; the token sacrificed to pay for Bound Soul is permanently lost. Bound Soul may be used again if this character is subsequently killed, but each return requires another permanent Activation Token sacrifice.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
  </sharedSelectionEntries>
</catalogue>